          "format": "html",
          "content": "<p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words\" node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">現在 Grok 免費能夠用哪些功能？ （已經沒有deep research了嗎？）</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e43e364c-07ba-4e26-8b83-7fdcbca805df",
      "role": "Assistant",
      "parts": [
        {
          "format": "html",
          "content": "<div class=\"streamdown-chat-md\"><div class=\"sd:space-y-4 sd:whitespace-normal sd:[&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 sd:[&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0\"><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">免費版（Free / $0）目前仍可用，但額度有限，官方沒有公開具體數字。</strong><br>\n（資訊截至 2026 年 10 月底，以 x.ai/pricing 與多方報導為準）</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0\">免費版目前能用的主要功能</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\" class=\"marker:text-fg-secondary\">\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">基本聊天（Chat）</strong>：有限額度（官方只寫 Limited，沒公佈每天／每小時幾次）。可用於一般問答、寫作、即時網頁搜尋 + X 搜尋。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">圖片生成（Imagine）</strong>：有限額度（Limited）。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">Grok Build</strong>（寫程式／建應用等）：有限額度。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">語音模式（Voice）</strong>：有限額度（有自己的重置節奏）。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">標準 X 功能</strong>。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\">部分較輕量的模型／Fast 模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">免費額度與付費方案的「每週共享用量池」是分開的。付費用完後仍可回到免費額度繼續用（只是功能與速度會受限）。</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0\">免費版沒有的／明顯受限的功能</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\" class=\"marker:text-fg-secondary\">\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">影片生成</strong>：沒有（從 Premium $30 起）。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">Grok Bot</strong>：沒有（從 Premium 起）。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">最新旗艦模型</strong>（如 Expert／Heavy／Grok 4.7 完整版）：通常鎖定付費。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">Grok API 存取</strong>：沒有（Plus 起才有，且 API 用量另計）。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">高額度使用</strong>：容易撞牆，尤其高峰時段。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0\">關於 Deep Research / DeepSearch</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">還沒有完全消失</strong>，但免費版已大幅受限。<br>\n早期（2025 年左右）免費用戶還能用一定次數的 DeepSearch／DeeperSearch，現在多半只剩很少量（有報導提到每天幾次等級，或乾脆很緊），完整深度研究與高額度主要留給付費方案。<br>\n如果你以前常用「Deep Research」功能，現在免費版體驗會明顯變差，這是很多人覺得「好像沒了」的原因。</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0\">目前方案概覽（The X Subscription，2026 年 10 月後新用戶適用）</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"relative group/table my-2\"><div class=\"relative w-fit max-w-full\"><div data-table-card=\"true\" class=\"relative rounded-[16px] bg-surface-l1 border border-border-l1 overflow-hidden\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"table-container relative clear-both flex flex-row overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar\"><table dir=\"auto\" class=\"table-card-row-dividers [&amp;_td_ul]:my-1 [&amp;_td_ol]:my-1 [&amp;_td_li]:my-0\"><thead class=\"sticky [top:var(--thead-sticky-top)] border-b-0 [&amp;_th]:h-auto bg-surface-l1 text-sm font-semibold text-fg-primary\"><tr class=\"[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base\"><th class=\"break-words text-fg-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"lg\">方案</th><th class=\"break-words text-fg-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"sm\">月費</th><th class=\"break-words text-fg-primary text-sm font-semibold align-middle ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"xl\">重點差異</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"sd:divide-y sd:divide-border\" data-streamdown=\"table-body\"><tr class=\"[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base\"><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"lg\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">Free</strong></td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"sm\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">$0</td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"xl\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">有限聊天、Imagine、Build、Voice</td></tr><tr class=\"[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base\"><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"lg\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">Plus</strong></td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"sm\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">$8</td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"xl\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">基礎共享用量池 + API + Cursor 等</td></tr><tr class=\"[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base\"><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"lg\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">Premium</strong></td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"sm\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">$30</td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"xl\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">4 倍用量 + Grok Bot + 最新模型 + 影片生成（最受歡迎）</td></tr><tr class=\"[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base\"><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"lg\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">Super</strong></td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"sm\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">$100</td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"xl\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">15 倍用量 + 優先權</td></tr><tr class=\"[tbody&gt;&amp;]:bg-surface-base\"><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"lg\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">Ultra</strong></td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"sm\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">$200</td><td class=\"break-words ps-2.5 pe-2.5 py-2 leading-snug\" data-col-size=\"xl\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">50 倍用量</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"absolute top-full inset-x-0 z-10 overflow-x-auto table-card-scrollbar-hidden\"><div class=\"table-card-scroll-sizer\" style=\"height: 1px; width: 483px;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"print:hidden mt-2 flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/table:opacity-100 group-focus-within/table:opacity-100 [@media(hover:none)]:opacity-100\"></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">總結</strong>：<br>\n免費版還在，適合偶爾問問題、輕度使用。但 Deep Research／深度搜尋、最新模型、影片、Bot 等高階功能，幾乎都要付費才好用。官方從不公開免費精確額度，實際能用多少會隨負載調整，建議自己實際試用確認目前限額。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">如果想看最新官方比較，直接去 <a href=\"https://x.ai/pricing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">x.ai/pricing</a> 最準。</p></div><span hidden=\"\"></span></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7f226d61-c8c7-4598-9b2f-080d77b9d928",
