      "parts": [
        {
          "format": "html",
          "content": "<p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words\" node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">正確來說應該如何觸發 deep research 呢？</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2f63478-6a2c-456a-8a14-1298a9956e5c",
      "role": "Assistant",
      "parts": [
        {
          "format": "html",
          "content": "<div class=\"streamdown-chat-md\"><div class=\"sd:space-y-4 sd:whitespace-normal sd:[&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 sd:[&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0\"><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">正確觸發 Deep Research / DeepSearch 的方式如下：</strong></p><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">目前介面（你截圖裡看到的）已經改成以 <strong class=\"font-semibold\">Modes（Fast / Build）</strong> 和 <strong class=\"font-semibold\">Skills</strong> 為主，DeepSearch 不一定會一直顯示成明顯按鈕，所以最穩定的方法是：</p><h3 dir=\"auto\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0\">1. 最推薦、最可靠的方法（主聊天介面）</h3><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">直接在訊息裡明確寫：</p><ul dir=\"auto\" class=\"marker:text-fg-secondary\">\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><span class=\"text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300\">Use DeepSearch on this: [你的問題]</span></li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><span class=\"text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300\">Do a deep research on [主題]</span></li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><span class=\"text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300\">Research this thoroughly with sources</span></li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\"><span class=\"text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300\">DeepSearch the latest information about...</span></li>\n</ul><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grok 看到這些關鍵字後，通常就會啟動深度研究模式（多步驟搜尋網頁 + X、交叉比對、附來源）。</p><h3 dir=\"auto\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0\">2. 介面有開關時</h3><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">在輸入框附近找看看有沒有 <strong class=\"font-semibold\">DeepSearch</strong> 的開關／按鈕（有時是放大鏡圖示或標籤）。<br>\n有的話先打開再送出問題。</p><h3 dir=\"auto\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0\">3. 在 Build 模式</h3><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">切換到 <strong class=\"font-semibold\">Build</strong> 後，輸入指令：</p><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"not-prose\"><div class=\"chat-code-block relative not-prose @container/code-block my-3\" data-testid=\"code-block\"><div data-code-card=\"true\" class=\"border border-border-l1 rounded-xl\"><div class=\"flex flex-row px-4 py-2 h-10 items-center rounded-t-xl bg-surface-elevated pr-1 border-b border-border-l1 dark:bg-surface-inset\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-fg-secondary select-none\">text</span><div class=\"ml-auto flex flex-row gap-0 print:hidden\"></div></div><div class=\"shiki not-prose relative [&amp;_pre]:overflow-auto [&amp;_pre]:rounded-b-lg [&amp;_pre]:px-4 [&amp;_pre]:py-4 !p-0\" style=\"border-radius: 0px 0px 12px 12px; border-top-color: currentcolor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: medium; border-right-color: ; border-right-style: ; border-right-width: ; border-bottom-color: ; border-bottom-style: ; border-bottom-width: ; border-left-color: ; border-left-style: ; border-left-width: ; border-image-source: ; border-image-slice: ; border-image-width: ; border-image-outset: ; border-image-repeat: ; padding: 0px 16px 16px; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 0.9em; font-family: var(--font-ibm-plex-mono); line-height: 1.5em; background-color: var(--surface-inset); color: var(--fg-primary); display: block; overflow: auto;\"><pre class=\"shiki slack-dark\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Code\" style=\"background-color: rgb(34, 34, 34); color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/deep-research [你的研究問題]</span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">這是 Grok Build 專用的深度研究指令。</p><h3 dir=\"auto\" class=\"font-semibold text-xl max-md:font-display max-md:text-heading-3 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0px] max-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-first-block:mt-0 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0\">4. 用 Skills 自訂（進階）</h3><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">你截圖裡的 Skills 系統可以自己建立一個叫 <span class=\"text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-300\">deep-research</span> 的 Skill，之後用「Use the deep-research skill」來觸發，效果會更固定。</p><hr class=\"border-border-l2 clear-both streamdown-first-block:mt-0 streamdown-last-block:mb-0\"><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong class=\"font-semibold\">補充說明：</strong></p><ul dir=\"auto\" class=\"marker:text-fg-secondary\">\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\">免費版還是可以用，但次數較少、深度較淺。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\">付費方案（尤其 Premium 以上）額度與深度會明顯比較好。</li>\n<li class=\"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal\">如果只是一般問問題，用 Fast 模式就夠；真正需要多方來源、交叉驗證、最新資訊時才用 DeepSearch。</li>\n</ul><p dir=\"auto\" class=\"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">你可以先試一句：<br>\n「Use DeepSearch on this: 目前 Grok 免費版還有哪些功能？」<br>\n看它會不會進入深度研究流程。</p></div><span hidden=\"\"></span></div>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}